<title>USA: Zaring unit acquires 150 sites near Dayton.</title>
<headline>Zaring unit acquires 150 sites near Dayton.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaring Homes Inc, a wholly owned subsidiary of Zaring National Corp said Friday that it will expand its Cincinnati operations with the acquisition of 150 single family home sites at Settlers Walk in Springboro, a southern suburb of Dayton, Ohio.</p>
<p>The company said the homes are expected to be initially priced from $200,000 to $250,000, and construction of two model homes will begin next month and open in the fall.</p>
<p>Zaring Homes is a regional builder of move-up homes, based in Cincinnati.</p>
</text>
